  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 627.9439833333333,
   "end": 632.88225,
   "transcript": "Why does everyone say PC has to wait, right? Why can't Rockstar just release it on day one?",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 628.03,
    "orig_end": 632.83
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 672.2549166666666,
   "end": 673.0724,
   "transcript": "Hackers, right?",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 672.24,
    "orig_end": 673.09
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 675.6916833333333,
   "end": 679.2118666666667,
   "transcript": "Oh, it's going to ruin the game for everyone, modding, etc.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 679.7957833333334,
   "end": 681.1805,
   "transcript": "That's not the main reason.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 682.7487333333333,
   "end": 684.73405,
   "transcript": "An ex-Rockstar developer, Mike York.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 685.4180666666666,
   "end": 686.4691166666667,
   "transcript": "He actually worked there.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 687.7036833333333,
   "end": 690.9569333333334,
   "transcript": "And he explained it really simply. Number one, PlayStation sells the most.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 692.1581333333334,
   "end": 693.54285,
   "transcript": "So PlayStation goes first.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 694.1768166666667,
   "end": 695.1277666666666,
   "transcript": "Money first.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 694.29,
    "orig_end": 695.02
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 697.7303666666667,
   "end": 700.3162833333333,
   "transcript": "Rockstar is not a charity, so it makes sense.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 697.76,
    "orig_end": 700.22
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 702.45175,
   "end": 707.2065,
   "transcript": "Number two, and this is the real one. His words: every single person has a different PC.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 708.25755,
   "end": 709.95925,
   "transcript": "So think about it like shoes.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 712.0279833333333,
   "end": 715.06435,
   "transcript": "Making a game for the PS5 is like making one shoe,",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 712.07,
    "orig_end": 715.0
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 718.2008166666667,
   "end": 721.6209,
   "transcript": "and everybody who owns a PS5 has the exact same foot size.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 718.15,
    "orig_end": 721.54
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 723.4060166666667,
   "end": 724.1067166666667,
   "transcript": "Easy.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 727.3099166666667,
   "end": 730.1961333333334,
   "transcript": "Making a game for PC is like making a shoe.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 727.29,
    "orig_end": 730.18
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 736.0019333333333,
   "end": 738.2708666666666,
   "transcript": "It's like making one shoe that has to fit Shaq.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 736.0,
    "orig_end": 738.26
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 739.7223166666666,
   "end": 740.4063333333334,
   "transcript": "A toddler.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 743.39265,
   "end": 744.8607833333333,
   "transcript": "Fit your uncle with a weird toe.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 743.3,
    "orig_end": 744.9
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 753.7196333333334,
   "end": 757.4400166666667,
   "transcript": "Fit the guy who's still running a graphics card from 2016 and refuses to upgrade.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 753.67,
    "orig_end": 757.41
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 760.0426166666666,
   "end": 761.0436166666667,
   "transcript": "You know who you are.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 765.1310333333333,
   "end": 766.3822833333334,
   "transcript": "1080 Ti users.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 773.72295,
   "end": 775.8917833333334,
   "transcript": "York says they test on, his words,",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 773.79,
    "orig_end": 775.86
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 777.42665,
   "end": 778.8614166666666,
   "transcript": "10 or 20 different setups.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 777.42,
    "orig_end": 778.85
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 780.3462333333333,
   "end": 781.8477333333333,
   "transcript": "Not one, not two.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 780.32,
    "orig_end": 781.77
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 782.8654166666666,
   "end": 783.7996833333333,
   "transcript": "10 or 20.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 788.9214666666667,
   "end": 791.64085,
   "transcript": "So PC doesn't wait because they're afraid,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 791.9745166666667,
   "end": 795.2778166666667,
   "transcript": "it's just that the testing, the complexity",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 796.3956,
   "end": 797.5133833333333,
   "transcript": "takes some time.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 800.3161833333334,
   "end": 803.7362666666667,
   "transcript": "Red Dead had the exact same problem and they solved it within a year.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 812.6952166666666,
   "end": 814.5971166666667,
   "transcript": "Now, before the comments come for me,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 815.9151,
   "end": 817.6501666666667,
   "transcript": "let me argue against myself,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 818.818,
   "end": 820.7199,
   "transcript": "because there's a real case for 2028.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 825.0075166666667,
   "end": 825.9918333333334,
   "transcript": "Number one is money.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 828.0939333333333,
   "end": 830.88005,
   "transcript": "Be honest. If you are a PC player like me",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 828.2,
    "orig_end": 830.86
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 833.4993333333333,
   "end": 834.48365,
   "transcript": "and you can't wait,",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 833.53,
    "orig_end": 834.54
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 835.0175166666667,
   "end": 835.8683666666667,
   "transcript": "what are you doing?",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 838.2707666666666,
   "end": 841.39055,
   "transcript": "You're buying it on the PS5. You're going to buy a PS5.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 842.5583833333334,
   "end": 844.1433,
   "transcript": "Right? You're like me.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 845.1276166666667,
   "end": 846.6624833333333,
   "transcript": "We're not so different.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 849.19835,
   "end": 852.2180333333333,
   "transcript": "And then, and when the PC version comes out, you're buying it again.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 872.7719,
   "end": 880.7632166666667,
   "transcript": "GTA 5, you guys don't know, has sold over 230 million copies across every console known to man.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 872.87,
    "orig_end": 880.74
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 883.8162666666667,
   "end": 886.0685166666667,
   "transcript": "Rockstar knows you'll buy it twice.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 883.83,
    "orig_end": 885.88
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 899.3317666666667,
   "end": 902.2847166666667,
   "transcript": "Their whole business model is your impatience.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 899.35,
    "orig_end": 902.12
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 910.1926166666667,
   "end": 913.8295833333333,
   "transcript": "Another rumour which is going on is the next-gen consoles.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 915.5980166666667,
   "end": 923.7895333333333,
   "transcript": "Some people think Rockstar is holding off PC launch with those. So when the PS6 comes out, they're going to launch it with that.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 924.1899333333333,
   "end": 925.2243,
   "transcript": "I don't think so.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 924.27,
    "orig_end": 925.17
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 929.1448833333334,
   "end": 930.3961333333333,
   "transcript": "Because this is my call.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 929.1,
    "orig_end": 930.42
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 934.0331,
   "end": 941.2736666666667,
   "transcript": "November 2027 is when the PC version of GTA 6 will be released.",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 948.9813666666666,
   "end": 949.99905,
   "transcript": "That's going to be the video.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 948.98,
    "orig_end": 950.02
   },
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 950.69975,
   "end": 954.20325,
   "transcript": "Now make sure to tell me in the comments: are you, as a PC player,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 954.9373166666667,
   "end": 955.5379166666667,
   "transcript": "going to wait,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 956.4721833333333,
   "end": 957.7401166666667,
   "transcript": "or are you going to be like me,",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 958.20725,
   "end": 959.90895,
   "transcript": "buying a console and playing it?",
   "no_refine": true
  },
  {
   "clip": "gta6-pc-release-synced.mov",
   "start": 963.81285,
   "end": 965.4478166666667,
   "transcript": "Catch you guys inside, at the next one.",
   "_refine": {
    "orig_start": 963.79,
    "orig_end": 965.44
   },
   "no_refine": true
  }
 ]
